Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,小心了 天使们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch you angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能够幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will survive this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是场灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是Bartholomew\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说天使们都是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we said the angels are dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin Tran\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,原本只是个优等生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was a good straight A kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,却被卷进了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he got sucked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这些天使的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this this angel crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他成了先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He became a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想做先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna be a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.57,0:00:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi,mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我对我的朋友都这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tortured all my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.03,0:00:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 我们告诉过你不要和Crowley交谈 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man,we told you not to talk to Crowley,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他会扰乱你的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He messes with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你名单上要除掉的第一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the first name on your to do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin不可能全身而退\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way that Kevin getting out of this intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,最后事情却总是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And always end up screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你救我 并不是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't save me,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样做是为你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果当时我们俩情况对调\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the situation were reversed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,换做是我奄奄一息 你也会为我做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was dying,you'd do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 Dean 我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,Dean.I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如今\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:01:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 地堡里闹鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep,bunker is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说这里是地球上最安全的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you said it's the safest place on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道肯定没有东西能进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I know nothing got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the bunker is warded and sigiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,从里到外都做了防护措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}From top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没东西能从外面闯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way that something came in from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那么这个鬼魂 肯定是死在这里面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK,so whoever is haunting us,died here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 是死去的学者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,died Man of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,that doesn't track.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是五十年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we are the first people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次住进这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That occupied this place in fifty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个鬼魂为何等了这么久才出来吓唬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would a ghost wait for so long to get a spook on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,比较有可能是Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh,must have been more reasonable with Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是我亲自火化了他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I burned his body myself,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你烧了他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK,so you cremated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.91,0:03:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们也烧了Bobby的尸体 他不也回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cremated Bobby,too.He came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:03:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it,I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个鬼魂 绝对不是Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ghost is not Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将躯体交予大地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We commit our body to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,尘归尘 土归土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth to earth,ashes to ashes,dust to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,带着清晰坚定的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a clear and certain hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,希望能拥有永恒的来生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the resurrection unto the eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,依照上帝伟大的造诣\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to mighty working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们因为他而拥有宁静\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are by his able to subdue all things up to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谁 那个人类还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?The dead human or.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,附身她时被杀的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel who's killed while possessing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca有不少朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca had a lot of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,比如像Metatron一样的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends like Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你恐怕找错地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are looking in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.87,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca和Metatron曾经是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca and Metatron were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是很久之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,自从坠落之后就再无联络了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had no contact since the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Naomi Metatron 天堂的战役 还有那些权利争夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi,Metatron,heavenly battles,politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她都放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃了所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca告诉我们 作为天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca taught us the angels have lost touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经遗失了自己真正的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}With our true missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我们是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那些忏悔者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The penitents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她的追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,又是一个帮派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,和其他的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会挑起战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't make war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谦卑地生活在人类之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live humbly among these humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们现在已经暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了其他所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,然后杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谁杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还能是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个怪物 Bartholomew\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monster,Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿叮了几声 探测仪有了点儿反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of dings,a little EMF activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是就没有其他的动静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他暂时躲回屏障里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he is back in the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,摸索着等待时机再次现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fumbling to break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道上次Bobby花了几个月才成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to figure it took Bobby months to make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin只是 他有这方面的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's only...he is knew of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 好吧 该你值班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,alright you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我干不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咖啡机半夜乱响什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee buzzing bump in the night crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我有很重要的事情要跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got serious thing to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会对着这玩意说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna saying them to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.61,0:07:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你想要的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not choose this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你努力拼命过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You busted your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是却失去了所有 所有你爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost everything,everyone you loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,最后你得到了什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,连自己的性命也没能保住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我本该好好保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的错让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我做什么都无济于事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing I can do to make that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你看见这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,did you see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,灯光怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights were.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,费劲巴拉花了好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did not spend months struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,冲破屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}To break through the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,出来之后不但动不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to get stuck in listening Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还得听Dean Winchester自怨自艾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a self-pity session.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我活着的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't hear enough of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那些话就已经听了无数遍了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能看见我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy,Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,最开始你可能维持不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not hold this one for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要时间练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们应该长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should talk fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你不应该在天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最应该进天堂的那个人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean if anybody deserves an express pass to paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我去不了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I couldn't,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能进\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂天堂关门大吉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven has closed for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,天使们堕天之后 所有死去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who's died since angels fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,都只能卡在屏障之后 等待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stuck in the veil,waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这里糟糕透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's bad in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟在车管所排长队一样糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like DMV-Line-Times-Infinity bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙 帮我一个大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a favor,a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:08:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,找到我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley告诉你她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley only told you she is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只是为了扰乱你的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}To mess with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有听信他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going off his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我有自己的消息来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have my own sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这里十分拥挤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crowd in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都被困在这个世界里等待真正的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us stuck in the other side for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我能够得到和传递一些信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been able to pass the messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在鬼魂之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirit to spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我和一个新来的鬼魂取得了联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made contact with another new arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她说她见过我妈 就在一周之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she saw my mom just a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 但是跟你对话的这个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,this spirit that you ghost telephone with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你甚至连她是谁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't even know about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她名字叫Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她说她在威奇托市的一处森林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she's in a forest in Wichita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这就是所有你知道的信息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it,that's all you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那里的长距离通话质量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long distance communication within the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可不怎么理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is not ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我需要你们过去看一看\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I need you go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,召唤她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summon her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看看她还知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what else she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你想要弥补过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you wanna make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友这么急匆匆的是要去哪儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your friend going in such a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你来晚了 他已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late.He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们头儿找你有一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our boss'been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,威奇托市 堪萨斯州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wichita Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了 这就是那座桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,that's the trestle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin说那个鬼魂就被困在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin said the spirit was stuck nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她是在这儿死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她是被什么东西杀死的 熊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What got her,a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们居然要召唤一只叫Candy的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still stuck in the fact that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是没法消化这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to summon a ghost named Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,事先声明 Kevin说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know just 'cause Kevin said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.39,0:10:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他听到他妈妈还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he heard his mom's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.25,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,并不代表她还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean she.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 这件事怎么说也是我们欠他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,at least we owe this kid a try,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你都带了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,既然她死了才一周左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,she's not only been dead for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,so I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她一定迫不及待地想出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could use as much help as she can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.18,0:10:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:10:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不能放过任何一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要再等多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么着急是要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have some place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他的刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}His blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是按安全协议办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard security protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这年头还是万事小心为妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be too careful these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 Bartholomew\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.91,0:11:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太久没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点儿起鸡皮疙瘩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I felt the chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:11:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这儿很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 我是Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley,This is Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,给我回个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me when you get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.97,0:12:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这已经是你第三次转到他的语音信箱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your third unanswered voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有想过 可能他对你不感兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever think maybe he's just not that into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们手上最后一个指向Tran夫人的可靠线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,he's our last confirmed link to Mrs.Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我承认他是个杀千刀的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,he's a flaming douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但是至少他是个大活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at least we know he's real which is more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,比这个不见踪影的Candy靠谱多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than we can say of this Candy-No-Show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Candy - 有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Candy - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是你吗 是你吗 Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there?Is that you,Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真是疯狂啊 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madness,wasn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,20个天使退居战线之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}A peer your force of twenty behind the enemy lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,跟Raphael\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launching and encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,和他的手下开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against Raphael and his loyalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那是预料中的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a calculated risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我一度以为你失去了理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you've gone insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对你的领导能力提出质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I questioned your leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对派给我的任务疑虑不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second guess every step that I campaigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是我的指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're my commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我缄默不言 按命令行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held my tongue,I followed orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.51,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他的追随者们不是死了就是被囚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of his loyalists died or captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的险冒对了 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gamble paid off.You.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们听到了你胜利的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've heard your victory spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你又被召回戍卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got called back to the garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,成为了 伟大的Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You became The Great Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我只是个低等兵而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I stay behind just a grunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你 也为自己闯出了一番名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gained reputation for yourself as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我把俘虏交给你看管\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captives I left in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你 残忍的折磨并杀害了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tortured and killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是服从命令杀掉他们而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ordered to kill those captives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经脱离天堂太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been flying solo for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,忘记了天使的义务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've forgotten that's what angels do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We follow orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但你却没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会再服从命令了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我是发号施令的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那儿 就是那儿 停停停\N{\fnArial\fs30}There,there,there.Stop,stop,stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在盒子里 他们把我关在盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a box.They put me in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有人都在盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us in boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一个挨着一个 我 Gerome 还有Linda\N{\fnArial\fs30}Side by side,me,Gerome,Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Linda是 - Tran太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Linda's - Mrs.Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy 那些盒子 你知道它们在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy,these boxes,where were they.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一片漆黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,后面有一个小铁窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a back chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们彼此能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talked to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 墙壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你能描述一下墙壁和地面的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you describe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,光滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,水泥地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是门 门是金属的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for the door,that was...metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 凹凸不平\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...like,ridged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,凹凸不平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ridged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说有波浪弧度吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like corrugated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过抬门 没抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to lift the door but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,门从外面被锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a storage unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道是谁在看着你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was holding you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这里太黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're so dark in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们进来的时候 强光刺得我睁不开眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they came,I can barely see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,最先走进来的那个 我觉得是个英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first guy...was British I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,矮矮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of short.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,说话都是说给自己听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love hearing himself talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的目的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,说我活着比死了更有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said I was worth more alive than dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但后来他突然就不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he stopped coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,另外一个人继续来查看我们的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it was just...the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为就剩他一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it was just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我使劲地跑 能跑多远跑多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran so hard...so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy,you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tran太太怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Mrs.Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她也许还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟她儿子可不是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what you told her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我说我们在一起的时候她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said she was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但后来发生了什么我就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened after.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但我宁愿她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her sake,I hope she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,附近有三处仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay there're 3 storage facilities nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,最近的一个离这里大概有1英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closest one is about a mile on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 我去查了查Candy的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I...I dug up some stuff on Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,发现她被一个位高权重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out she was the kept women of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,议员包养了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful congressman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有小道媒体称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gossip blog said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他恨不得舔遍她走过的每一寸土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worshiped the ground she walked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是舔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他有恋足癖\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had foot fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以Crowley绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Crowley was holding the.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一个高官深爱的美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beloved tootsies of powerful politician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个先知深爱的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the beloved mother of the powerful prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是他的砝码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但为什么要杀了Candy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why killed Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你也听到她的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她想要逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to make a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,也许Crowley是想杀鸡儆猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Crowley wanted to make an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是留下的负责人这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,the guy left in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley更希望他的人质们都好好活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley wanted the victims alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 你想给他颁发个好人勋章吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what,you want to give him a metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底 Crowley才是最初\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,Crowley's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.38,0:18:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们囚禁起来的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put them into the cells in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是摆出事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just talking it out,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,梳理案情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,公事公办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Businesslike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我们发现这些人的实际用处并不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Realizing they have more trouble than they were worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我们就清除了这群人类帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We purged our human allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,征用了Boyle教友会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then commanded Boyle Ministry,Inc.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从此自己用\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our own use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyle神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy Boyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把他和他的同伴变成了容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made him and his colleagues vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,留下了那些能承受的住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least,those who didn't go pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你很紧张吗 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nervous,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你的追随者都想让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your followers want me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定你是不是也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not entirely certain you don't too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我想要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们是朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那我能随时离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不认为你有离开的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I don't know why you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,外面到底有什么 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's out there for you Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,凭你一个人 你能干成什么大事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you really expect to accomplish on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己永远不可能找到Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never find Metatron that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know about Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你之所以追着Rebecca不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured that's why you're persuing Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,找上她的追随者 都是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaging with her follower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们处事的方式不同 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have different methods,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们的目标是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,找到Metatron 让所有天使回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find Metatron and restore our kind to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么杀了Rebecca和她的追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why kill Rebecca and her followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并不对你构成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not threat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但相比于放任自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But better to nip a fledgling faction in the bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是更喜欢防患于未然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than let it grow into a bigger threat down on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,用最小的牺牲 拯救更多的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A drop of blood to save a gallon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.98,0:19:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在征求你的同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.69,0:19:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,抓捕Metatron 我比Malachi那队快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will outrace Malachi in the hunt for Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定也比你一个人快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will certainly outrace you on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你能接受我的战略\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you can set aside your qualms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我合作的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}About methods for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒Metatron并不成问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason the two of us can't take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜这个人一米七不到 肤色惨白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess 5'5",pasty white.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,黑框嬉皮士眼镜 和上个地方那个人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black-rimmed hipster glasses,just like the last place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,全对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么可以帮助您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 我们是探员Nicks和McVie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,hi.Agents Nicks and McVie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看下你们的租赁记录吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I take a look at your rental records.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我经理不在这 我觉得我不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}My manager is not here.I really don't think I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 快拿记录来 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,the records,pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Barry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,把租赁记录活页夹拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring out the rental binder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这个就是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corridor Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,三个并排单元 和其它的分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three adjacent units,separated from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy说有三个人质 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean Candy said there were three hostages,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这三个都租给了同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK,it's all leased by the same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.19,0:21:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,叫D Webster\N{\fnArial\fs30}A D Webster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,D Webster\N{\fnArial\fs30}D Webster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是Daniel Webster的缩写吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,as in like Daniel Webster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这不像是Crowley开的低级玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I know a lame Crowley in-joke when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们说D Webster吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys say D Webster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你见过他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.You've seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这是记录上登记的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a name from the records.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他在我们仓库的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leasing another unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也租了一个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other side of the facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以带你们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,that would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你查一下走廊Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.Why don't you take corridor Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我和这个升级版Del一起过去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with the Del the funky homosapien.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.83,0:22:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tran女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs.Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tran女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs.Tran,hey hey hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.It's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.42,0:22:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.23,0:22:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:22:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他马上就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.47,0:23:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin和你一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Kevin with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定这间借给Webster了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is the one leased by Webster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.07,0:23:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 就是这间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:50.55,Note,,0,0,0,,(收件地址是Sam和Dean在堪萨斯的老家)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定这儿的主人不是Crowley吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't in Crowley's unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这些坐标是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.57,0:24:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron出现过的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sightings of Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他最近来过地球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.40,0:24:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,据我们所知有三次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times we know of so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.25,0:24:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是大规模地面行动的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the benefit of a massive ground operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.16,0:24:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都有我们的眼线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes and ears,everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.81,0:24:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.67,0:24:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就能知道他的实时位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we get an active location.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还要等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.15,0:24:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有了这些信息 我可以引他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this kind of information I'd lure him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.00,0:24:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你的利用价值很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would be an asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.03,0:24:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是最想整垮他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is as motivated as you to take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.44,0:24:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,跟其他天使集团的争斗让我忙得不可开交\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had my hands so full with the factions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.45,0:24:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,导致我无法一心完成主要目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has distracted me from the real goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.12,0:24:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有了你在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.20,0:24:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,新老板和终极叛党携手合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new boss and the ultimate rebel working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.25,0:24:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这会让那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the message that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.12,0:24:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想叛变的天使怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would send to the would-be dissidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.75,0:24:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定会明白 反抗只会是徒劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd finally understand that resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.36,0:25:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,想想我们会避免多少流血事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the bloodshed we could avert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.49,0:25:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想想团结一心的天使们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a united angel kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.51,0:25:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在天堂或者其它地方会有怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could accomplish in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.61,0:25:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.16,0:25:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Barth 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barth,what are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.09,0:25:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,做该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.97,0:25:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我要折磨这个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna torture the rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.41,0:25:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,逼问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out what he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.45,0:25:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,然后杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.36,0:25:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你要协助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.33,0:25:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.31,0:25:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.82,0:25:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有条电线连着控制板\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an electrical line leads to the control panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.56,0:25:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕得花点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,this might take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.11,0:26:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,先要把接地线关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to unplug the ground wire first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.97,0:26:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是标准美式色彩编码\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is standard US color-coding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.81,0:26:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就应该是绿色的线\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be the green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.11,0:26:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前帮Kevin做过工程俱乐部的作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping Kevin with his engineering club assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.12,0:26:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,学会了一两招\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've picked up a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他肯定闹着要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.79,0:26:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我相信你们没有蠢到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I trust you weren't foolish enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.79,0:26:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,带他一起来执行这种任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bring Kevin along on this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.73,0:26:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以把他留在了一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you left him somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.20,0:26:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.88,0:26:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只要打开这扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all we have to do is get this door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.79,0:26:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.27,0:26:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就能让我见着我儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll bring me to my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.03,0:26:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tran夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,Ms.Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.86,0:27:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一定要带我去见我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will take me to my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.81,0:27:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.71,0:27:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他当时说 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me,he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.96,0:27:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定会想加入这个行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You definitely want to be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.62,0:27:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个了解我事业的基础的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance to get in on the ground floor of my operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.71,0:27:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一次学习经验的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real learning experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.27,0:27:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就把它当做垫脚石 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it a stepping stone,my lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.38,0:27:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,和实习一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an internship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.21,0:27:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,早就该知道 实习都是见鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have known,internship suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.88,0:27:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Corwley任命的负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one Crowley left in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.43,0:27:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 多么荣幸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,what a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.54,0:27:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喂养猿人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeding the apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.56,0:28:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,拖地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hosing the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.29,0:28:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,洗粪桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washing up honey buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.15,0:28:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么好处都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}For zero credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.41,0:28:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 不知去向\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boss,MIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.18,0:28:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,地位太重要 不能来上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too important to show for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.14,0:28:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,连接下我的电话都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}To even return my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.69,0:28:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 最惨的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,you know the worst part.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.61,0:28:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然不能杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't even allowed to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而要保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.27,0:28:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,太变态了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean how sick is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.64,0:28:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是个年轻力壮的恶魔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I not a young vital demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.90,0:28:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有基本需求啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}With basic demon needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.54,0:28:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也有我的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.56,0:28:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,而我传话给Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I call Crowley to inform him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.37,0:28:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说我单枪匹马地抓住了Winchester兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I've single-handedly caught the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.61,0:28:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就算他接了我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he even answers my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.15,0:28:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,估计我连一声谢谢都听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'll get a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.35,0:28:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.31,0:29:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他不但不会感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't give you credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还会生你气\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything,he'll be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.01,0:29:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.23,0:29:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我和Crowley 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,me and Crowley,we're.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.09,0:29:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.73,0:29:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,铁哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thick as thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.96,0:29:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,上个月才见过 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw him just last month,we.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.20,0:29:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一起玩得很开心来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a grand old time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.47,0:29:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 怪不得之前都不见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,that's where he's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.15,0:29:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是去和人类开派对去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out partying with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.72,0:29:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然还和猎魔人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.20,0:29:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,而我在这里独自凋零\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I languish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.72,0:29:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个破地方 做着这份不能杀人的鬼工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this go-nowhere,no-kill,joke-of-a-job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.66,0:29:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,开派对 有点夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partying is a bit of an exaggeration.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.62,0:29:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这份工作太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This job blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.23,0:29:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.34,0:29:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我他们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.84,0:29:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.64,0:29:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.45,0:30:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩我一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.74,0:30:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你还看不出来吗 他说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see?He's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.32,0:30:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他都说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.40,0:30:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,I believe he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在把他干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew 没必要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew,it doesn't need to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.87,0:30:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel 看清现实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel,get your head out of the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.04,0:30:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们把你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why they brought you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.36,0:30:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,带出来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back from the battle field.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.96,0:30:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.95,0:30:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.85,0:30:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的领导想让那些人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our leaders wanted those captives killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.35,0:30:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道 你一定不会遵守命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they knew you'd stand away from their order.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.98,0:30:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,说 你没那个本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said you didn't have it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.51,0:30:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你做不到顾全大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you couldn't do what needed to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.99,0:30:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我的看法不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know different.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.84,0:30:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道你变了 - 我不是杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you've changed - I'm not a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.37,0:30:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,以前不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't,not then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.75,0:30:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,自从你杀了千万的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}But since then you've slaughtered thousands of angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.01,0:30:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了Malachi 夺取了他的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill Malachi's man for his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.45,0:30:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的我 以前我做过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I was,what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.14,0:30:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,与现在的我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.69,0:30:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 那你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?Then who were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.79,0:31:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和你并肩作战 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to work with you,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.31,0:31:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我需要证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.30,0:31:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要证明他们错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need proof that they were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.79,0:31:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,证明你可以顾全大局 完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you can do what has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.63,0:31:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须完成这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.54,0:31:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你一开始就没打算放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never free to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.01,0:31:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我的选择中 只有遵守命令 或者被清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only choice was to obey or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.91,0:31:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉听到这个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am truly sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.44,0:31:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我已经多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how long it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.62,0:31:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没干过这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I've done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.76,0:31:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.52,0:31:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢让我想起来 我到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}For reminding me what I truly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.08,0:32:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你拒绝得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your refusal makes perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.68,0:32:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直觉得 你比我强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always thought you're better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.44,0:32:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是不是应该让你的上司来宣告这次的测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we put your superior to order the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.70,0:32:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,以绝后患\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.97,0:32:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.95,0:32:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,天使与天使之间的斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels fighting angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.21,0:32:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,总归是要结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has to stop somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.67,0:32:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,最好从我这儿开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well stop as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.90,0:32:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.98,0:32:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.25,0:32:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我和叛徒间的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is between me and the rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.98,0:32:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,动手啊 赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it,victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.43,0:33:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.34,0:33:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.54,0:33:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.87,0:33:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,改过自新了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A penitent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.94,0:33:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.45,0:33:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来就没明白过 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never did understand,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.56,0:33:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没有流血 就没有和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no peace without blood shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.33,0:33:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.58,0:33:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 杀我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.28,0:34:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在等另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,we're saving you for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.40,0:34:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.51,0:34:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.69,0:34:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,把你交给Tran女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand you out to Mrs.Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.98,0:34:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,乐意之极\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.62,0:34:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.77,0:34:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.73,0:34:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.00,0:34:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去找我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.26,0:34:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin,you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.39,0:35:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kev\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.22,0:35:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.65,0:35:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.96,0:35:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.25,0:35:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.26,0:35:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想给你点儿时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we want give you a moment to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.14,0:35:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,处理 你懂得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,process.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.98,0:35:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How...I.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.46,0:35:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.77,0:35:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.13,0:35:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.88,0:35:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.15,0:35:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.92,0:35:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,全在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只有猎人的工具 没有书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,hunters' tools,no books.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.64,0:36:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没有纸 没有笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papers,pencils.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.82,0:36:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有高考成绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The SAT results.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.14,0:36:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,考得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.51,0:36:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你发现什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you get,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.09,0:36:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.01,0:36:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.52,0:36:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tran先生去世的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Tran died.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.89,0:36:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin还在襁褓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Kevin was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.99,0:36:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是Kevin对父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only piece of father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.87,0:36:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.76,0:36:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果Kevin的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Kevin's spirit's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.87,0:36:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,附在什么东西上的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bound to some object here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.73,0:36:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一定就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.70,0:36:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tran夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,Mrs.Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.26,0:36:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对Kevin的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.33,0:36:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多不了解的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Kevin's situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.49,0:36:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,把他带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.46,0:36:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是有风险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take him home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.38,0:36:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果灵魂长时间停留在人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirits,the longer that they are in the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.27,0:36:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a way of.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.76,0:36:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,结果不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it doesn't end up well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.46,0:37:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.64,0:37:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我的职责就是保证他的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job to keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.95,0:37:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我还活在这世上一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}For as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.28,0:37:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.92,0:37:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,制造了这场混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Created this chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.96,0:37:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我没能更好地解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I couldn't do more to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.45,0:37:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你从表面上看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.66,0:37:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是输了 Rebecca\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost the war,Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.43,0:37:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 你开辟了新的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you tried a new way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.36,0:37:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对此我深表尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my respect for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.81,0:37:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.01,0:37:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果必要的话 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I have to,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.30,0:37:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道来打架的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.04,0:37:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当我坠落的时候 我以为我没有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I fell,I thought I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.42,0:37:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是昨天 你让我看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But yesterday you showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.54,0:37:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有另一种选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there is a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.13,0:37:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I choose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.47,0:37:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.34,0:37:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.89,0:38:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.65,0:38:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要我 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have me,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.63,0:38:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.03,0:38:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.33,0:38:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这几年来 她一直被折磨 都是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's held tortured for years because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.17,0:38:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们又在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that I've found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.03,0:38:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再让她离开我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting her out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.57,0:38:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.24,0:38:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.77,0:38:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你失望了 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed you.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.30,0:38:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.44,0:38:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.65,0:38:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我当时有机会的话也会用刀杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have been a blade in that ass who possessed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.69,0:38:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就算扯平了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call it a square.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.84,0:38:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.32,0:38:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.69,0:38:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们把你送去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can thank us when we.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.67,0:38:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你所属的天堂的时候 你再谢我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you to heaven,where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.05,0:38:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?Until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.64,0:38:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好好跟妈妈待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the time with your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.09,0:38:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,享受无间断的 全天候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The uninterrupted 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.42,0:38:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不折不扣的亲子时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No escape quality time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.13,0:39:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.82,0:39:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我走之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.91,0:39:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys promise me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.34,0:39:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说 - 随便什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah - Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.40,0:39:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.86,0:39:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,能和好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.15,0:39:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.03,0:39:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看不见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause you can't see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.22,0:39:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我可看得见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean I can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.23,0:39:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一天吵来吵去不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drama,the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.88,0:39:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.92,0:39:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈带回家一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's taking home a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.00,0:39:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.22,0:39:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还都活生生的站在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're both still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.54,0:39:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.90,0:39:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
